# Version Log - Terramine Gold Rush Automator
# All changes from 2026-11-16 onwards recorded here

## 2026-11-16
### 4x4 Grid Support (Fixes P001)
- **New module `src/tilegrid.py`**: 
  - `detect_geometry()` finds N×N grid from tile seams (luminance 20th percentile dips)
  - `road_sides()` reads 4 edge openings from gold-road mask with cell-size-scaled thresholds
  - `tap_centre()` computes tap points from drawn geometry
  - `cell_rect()` helper
- **Updated `src/perception_v2.py`**:
  - Auto-detects grid size via `tilegrid.detect_geometry()`
  - 6×6 uses exemplar NCC classifier (preserves accuracy)
  - 4×4, 5×5, etc. use `road_sides()` arm reader
  - LEP/POT detection generalized for any N
- **Updated `src/solve_simple.py`**:
  - Infers grid size from grid keys
  - Bounds checks use `0 <= r,c < N`
  - Tap centres from `res["geom"]`
- **Updated `src/solve_from_image.py`**:
  - Delegates to `solve_simple.solve_and_validate()`
  - Uses `res["geom"]` for tap centres

